            },
            {
                "entry_id": "30bb897f-b883-3cbc-9cd5-f132e79b891b",
                "word": "thermidor",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "e488eb44-9076-4b0e-bb79-a24bf1b809bd",
                        "entry_id": "30bb897f-b883-3cbc-9cd5-f132e79b891b",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "thermidors"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "311964ce-8f4e-3c00-b945-efa461216c3b",
                        "entry_id": "30bb897f-b883-3cbc-9cd5-f132e79b891b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Onzième mois du calendrier républicain, qui commençait le 19 juillet et finissait le 18 août."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "eada14da-7f54-407e-972d-b74bdf12febe",
                                "sense_id": "311964ce-8f4e-3c00-b945-efa461216c3b",
                                "text": "Son père, président du tribunal révolutionnaire, s’était fait remarquer par tant d’énergie, que le pays ne fut pas tenable pour lui lorsque son père, assez méchant avocat, eût péri sur l’échafaud après le 9 thermidor."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "224c79b1-c622-4456-97b1-365f4db62e3a",
                                "sense_id": "311964ce-8f4e-3c00-b945-efa461216c3b",
                                "text": "Il a emprunté à Quinet l’idée que la date maudite de la Révolution n’est pas le 9 thermidor, mais le 31 mai 1793, quand la Convention a cédé au coup de force antiparlementaire de la rue et exclu les députés girondins."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b9e698ab-3a0e-40f8-985e-b668f6f3b7b5",
                        "source_entry_id": "30bb897f-b883-3cbc-9cd5-f132e79b891b",
                        "source_sense_id": "311964ce-8f4e-3c00-b945-efa461216c3b",
                        "target_lang_word": "Thermidor",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Thermidor",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "64d0b429-ab29-33e1-b120-7bf5d9ee8dc7",
                                        "entry_id": "3dd36c8a-5732-3bea-9d2f-7eb13b004d70",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "elfter Monat (19.7. – 17.8.) der neuen Zeitrechnung der französischen Revolution"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "59468ba6-b03a-434b-bd21-5bf0a46b4896",
                                                "sense_id": "64d0b429-ab29-33e1-b120-7bf5d9ee8dc7",
                                                "text": "„Aber zu wissen, ob die Königin Liebhaber hatte, ob Dumouriez schon seit Valmy zum Verrat entschlossen war, ob im Prairial die Bergpartei oder die Gironde angefangen hat und im Thermidor die Jakobiner oder die Ebene, was hat das für den Verlauf der Revolution zu bedeuten, deren Ursachen sehr tief liegen und deren Wirkungen unberechenbar sind?“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3a894d50-8be4-4d7b-8818-685f8fd793de",
                        "source_entry_id": "30bb897f-b883-3cbc-9cd5-f132e79b891b",
                        "source_sense_id": "311964ce-8f4e-3c00-b945-efa461216c3b",
                        "target_lang_word": "Hitzemonat",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Hitzemonat",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4ae0ac4d-51ec-3b74-a716-c9ec22e2904c",
                                        "entry_id": "a1f2b91a-85d8-37d2-a175-e01b34c0101a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "elfter Monat des französischen Revolutionskalenders"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "eb9bd686-144c-4bf1-9436-7527d6f56c79",
                        "source_entry_id": "30bb897f-b883-3cbc-9cd5-f132e79b891b",
                        "source_sense_id": "311964ce-8f4e-3c00-b945-efa461216c3b",
                        "target_lang_word": "Thermidor",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Thermidor",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "00ef3b26-3a08-38d6-9e1b-785221c122ed",
                                        "entry_id": "d55f40d8-9f2d-313e-a254-db3cb4a073d3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The eleventh month of the French Republican Calendar, from July 19 or 20 to August 17 or 18."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "historical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Thermidor",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "25ceb9df-a220-313d-8879-f4d050657409",
                                        "entry_id": "a5a94890-5a19-356d-9ef1-0ccb05e9f595",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A counterrevolution; a coup d'état resembling the Thermidorian Reaction."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2132d791-119d-4311-86ed-5489b8361d4b",
                                                "sense_id": "25ceb9df-a220-313d-8879-f4d050657409",
                                                "text": "According to Sartre — this was a famous polemic — Camus had now made his Thermidor (counter-revolution) by attempting to stand outside or above history;"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6a07a921-e5ec-4123-92db-2ad77d57cbb3",
                                                "sense_id": "25ceb9df-a220-313d-8879-f4d050657409",
                                                "text": "So the author, after seeking vainly between the editions of 1938 and 1965 a peg on which to hang his Thermidor, in the end gave up and labeled the Russian case \"permanent revolution,\" without, however, explaining how this aberrant outcome of the Bolshevik fever came about."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c9eafe73-db02-492d-9543-f22624fe8196",
                                                "sense_id": "25ceb9df-a220-313d-8879-f4d050657409",
                                                "text": "The year —that was the beginning of the Soviet Thermidor.43 Thus Trotsky finally recognized that a Thermidor had in fact occurred, not as an overt bourgeois coup but as a more subtle political shift within the ruling party."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cf8f0176-ea0e-4679-8ea0-7e7c378db68e",
                                                "sense_id": "25ceb9df-a220-313d-8879-f4d050657409",
                                                "text": "Usually, in a Thermidor, the democratic reforms that appeared early in the revolution are wiped out along with many of the radical policies."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4c0df335-399a-40b7-92a9-9f650ea4ada3",
                        "source_entry_id": "30bb897f-b883-3cbc-9cd5-f132e79b891b",
